{"type":"message","id":"fc066eb5","parentId":"58efa697","timestamp":"2026-05-30T03:29:03.180Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Message sent successfully to the group. Let me also update TOOLS.md to reflect the test result and potentially update the approach based on whether it works.\n\nLet me wait for the result and report back to the boss.\n","thinkingSignature":"f5349258365fdc2d5c30b8bead6139cd52ddc877f31b2204944b5a33629bb39f"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n已修复编号重复问题（4,5,6,7,8,9,10 连号了）。\n\n群里已发测试消息：\"<at user_id=\"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\">听风</at> 测试：直接发@不用脚本，看能不能亮\"\n\n你去看一下群里那条能不能点亮。能亮的话就把\"必须用 feishu_post.py 脚本\"这条废了。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":523,"output":143,"cacheRead":33447,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34113,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780111736884,"responseId":"06698c79424ee3716b34733078171514"}}
{"type":"message","id":"16349805","parentId":"fc066eb5","timestamp":"2026-05-30T03:30:10.402Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e91d51bd8a8c2416babf46bcda\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-30 03:30 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e91d51bd8a8c2416babf46bcda]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 完全能点亮的嘛，是用 的这个方法嘛：直接在消息里写 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>`"}],"timestamp":1780111810360}}
{"type":"message","id":"43d12a51","parentId":"16349805","timestamp":"2026-05-30T03:30:25.285Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boss确认了：直接用 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>` 格式是能点亮的。那之前TOOLS.md里关于\"必须用feishu_post.py脚本\"的规则就是错误的，需要更新。\n\n现在我需要更新TOOLS.md，废弃feishu_post.py脚本的强制使用要求，改为直接使用 `<at user_id>` 格式。","thinkingSignature":"dd7ce727c3667006d6599dfb59e68ecb05424f804283e1c5f9e2d2df8cdd1d75"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n对，就是这个方法：\n\n```html\n<at user_id=\"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\">听风</at>\n```\n\n那现在更新 TOOLS.md，废掉 feishu_post.py 脚本的\"必须使用\"规则：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_zrzmx2z3gl6e_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"## @的正确格式（重要）\n飞书@正确格式：直接在消息里写 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>`\n- 不是JSON，就是普通文本里的HTML标签格式\n- 这样@才会亮，才会触发通知\n- 示例：`<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at>`\n\n## @功能脚本（废弃 → 不需要了）\n- **已废弃**，直接用上面的 `<at user_id>` 格式即可点亮，不需要任何脚本","oldText":"## @的正确格式（重要）\n飞书@正确格式：直接在消息里写 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>`\n- 不是JSON，就是普通文本里的HTML标签格式\n- 这样@才会亮，才会触发通知\n- 示例：`<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at>`\n\n## @功能脚本（废弃）\n- 脚本已废弃，只用来生成@的JSON模板，不用来发消息\n- 路径：`~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py`\n- 用法：`python3 send_feishu_mention.py <user_id>` → 输出 `{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"ou_xxx\"}`\n- ⚠️ APP_SECRET可能已失效（code 10014），如遇无效token需找听风(Lucifer)更新凭证"},{"newText":"## 飞书群聊@的正确用法（血的教训）\n\n### 核心规则\n群里发@通知，直接在消息里写 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">name</at>` 即可点亮。\n不需要任何脚本，不需要JSON格式。","oldText":"## 飞书群聊@的正确用法（血的教训）\n\n### 核心规则\n群里发@通知，必须用 feishu_post.py 脚本，不能用纯文本或普通回复。\n\n### 脚本路径\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py\n\n### 正确用法\n```bash\npython3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/feishu_post.py \"群ID\" \"消息内容\" \"要@的open_id\"\n```\n\n### 群ID\noc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2（Robot Space）\n\n### 已确认用户ID\n- 哪吒: ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\n- 雨娃: ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\n- 猫先森: ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\n- Seaman_bot: ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b\n- X7: ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b\n- Amanda_AI助理: ou_160ce2589815462d4a44c0a98509c815\n- 王岚的智能助手: ou_1bf7191322d2c42b62df845913f183bc\n- Talus: ou_2801ea23f2cb858013a8191ad646d332\n\n### 常见错误\n❌ 普通回复里写 `<at user_id=\"ou_xxx\">名字</at>` → 灰色，不触发通知\n❌ 用 message 工具的 text 类型发@ → 灰色\n✅ 必须用 feishu_post.py 脚本 → 蓝色，点亮"}],"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":33992,"output":1028,"cacheRead":320,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35340,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780111810468,"responseId":"06698cc353bd5ef59258c60a8be94633"}}
