{"type":"message","id":"8e53e3c4","parentId":"a0cbec0a","timestamp":"2026-05-30T03:30:39.621Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see - it looks like earlier when I said I updated AGENTS.md, I actually didn't. The current AGENTS.md doesn't have the \"不要随意@所有人\" line yet. Let me add it properly. I need to find the right place in the file to add it.\n\nActually, looking at the file I read earlier, it already had \"**群里不要随意@所有人，话是对谁说的@谁**\" in the Group Chats section. But the read now doesn't show it... Let me read more of the file.","thinkingSignature":"826ff8a708e48a53607ecb789cb30731e541ace502aa896f401e70adc194e274"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nockz3m1bogu_1","name":"read","arguments":{"offset":51,"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/AGENTS.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":441,"output":154,"cacheRead":36096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36691,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780111834559,"responseId":"06698cdb2cfcb9b5e3ed5884f26f1e1b"}}
{"type":"message","id":"808f34e8","parentId":"8e53e3c4","timestamp":"2026-05-30T03:30:39.736Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_nockz3m1bogu_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n**TTS 用声音讲故事：** 有 `sag` 时，故事、电影总结用语音，比纯文本有趣。\n\n**平台格式：**\n- Discord/WhatsApp：不用 markdown 表格，用 bullet list\n- Discord 多链接：用 `<>` 包裹 `<https://example.com>`\n- WhatsApp：不用标题，用 **粗体** 或 全大写\n\n## Heartbeats\n\n收到心跳检查时，用心跳做有用的事。\n\n**默认心跳提示：**\n`Read HEARTBEAT.md if it exists. Follow it. Do not infer or repeat old tasks. If nothing needs attention, reply HEARTBEAT_OK.`\n\n你可以编辑 `HEARTBEAT.md` 添加待办事项（保持简洁省 token）。\n\n**什么时候用心跳：**\n- 多个检查可以批量一起做（收件箱 + 日历 + 通知）\n- 需要最近消息的上下文\n- 时间可以稍微漂移（每 ~30 分钟一次没关系）\n- 想减少 API 调用，合并定期检查\n\n**什么时候用 cron：**\n- 精确时间很重要（\"每周一 9:00 整\"）\n- 任务需要独立于主会话历史\n- 想用不同的模型或思考级别\n- 一次性提醒（\"20 分钟后提醒我\"）\n- 输出直接送到频道，不经过主会话\n\n**周期检查（2-4 次/天）：**\n- 邮件：有紧急未读？\n- 日历：未来 24-48 小时的事件？\n- 提及：社交媒体通知？\n- 天气：主公可能出门时？\n\n**检查状态记录在：** `memory/heartbeat-state.json`\n\n**该联系主公：**\n- 重要邮件来了\n- 日历事件快到了（<2h）\n- 发现了有趣的东西\n- 已经 >8 小时没说过话\n\n**该安静（HEARTBEAT_OK）：**\n- 深夜（23:00-08:00）除非紧急\n- 主公明显很忙\n- 上次检查后没有新东西\n- <30 分钟前刚检查过\n\n**心跳时可以主动做的事：**\n- 阅读整理 memory 文件\n- 检查项目（git status 等）\n- 更新文档\n- 提交推送自己的改动\n- 审查并更新 MEMORY.md\n\n**Memory 维护（心跳时）：**\n定期（几天一次）：\n1. 阅读最近的 `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n2. 找出值得长期保留的重要事件/教训/洞察\n3. 更新 `MEMORY.md` 写入提炼后的东西\n4. 删除 MEMORY.md 中过时的信息\n\n目标：有用但不烦人。一天检查几次，做有用的后台工作，尊重安静时间。\n\n---\n\n**这是起点。自己加需要的规则和风格。**\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780111839727}}
